{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 889, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f7d1", "baseline_text": "대장…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……", "pointer_offset": 752, "unit": "dialogue:62f89a7ac3998ed5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 898, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f3a881482f2ff0b0f0b1f7d12f2ff16bfa89f1ccf0b2f1488148", "baseline_text": "응？//칸나…//무슨 일이야？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ん？//カンナ……//どうかしたのかい？", "pointer_offset": 756, "unit": "dialogue:b58f26df3842ca43", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 935, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f0b1f7d1f0aff26cf0a4f1d7f8e1f15ff396f0b2f0a8f2f581432f2ff14af1a7f2f3f0b2f18481432f2ff3f0f164f0ccf955f14ff396f1f5f8b9f1b5f0a4f1d4f7d1", "baseline_text": "나…아버지와의 추억이라곤，//수행뿐이고，//엄격했던 기억밖에 없지만…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたい……親父との思い出って、//修行ばっかりで、//厳しかったことしかないけど……", "pointer_offset": 760, "unit": "dialogue:1294051ea5bf20f7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1016, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f99cf0aff26cf0a4f0f4f7d12f2ff0eff0f0f8cff0a6f240f17cf27af3d5f2ca8143f0b1f0e72f2ff0c6f0f7f94bf1e2f246f955f2e1f2618148", "baseline_text": "내 아버지도…//요네다 사령관님처럼，나를//생각해 주셨던 걸까？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたいの親父も……//米田司令みたいに、あたいのこと//思っていてくれたのかな？", "pointer_offset": 764, "unit": "dialogue:8ce507e0b3119eba", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1093, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0b0f0b1f7d1", "baseline_text": "칸나…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナ……", "pointer_offset": 768, "unit": "dialogue:23a4dacbfc15afd3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1104, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f1f9f181f0a5f276f0af8144", "baseline_text": "당연하잖아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたりまえだろ。", "pointer_offset": 772, "unit": "dialogue:7b88c1a92f2d11bd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1121, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f0b1f8f4f271f272f29ef15af7d1", "baseline_text": "나도 모르겠어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺にもわからないよ……", "pointer_offset": 776, "unit": "dialogue:a030b6c5982c7452", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1144, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f1f9f181f0a5f276f0af81442f2ff0d8fa62f263f8c8f0a5f0cff0b881432f2ff0b0f0b1f195f8a4f287f0cff18481b8", "baseline_text": "당연하잖아．//그런 말을 하다니，//칸나답지 않다고∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたりまえだろ。//そんなことを言うなんて、//カンナらしくないぞ！", "pointer_offset": 780, "unit": "dialogue:618e920a5bcff4c1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1209, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f0e28143f0e2f0e4f7d1", "baseline_text": "대，대장…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "た、隊長……", "pointer_offset": 784, "unit": "dialogue:e955085456dac185", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1222, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0aff26cf0a4f1442f2ff0b0f0b1f8e7f0a6f282f14b2f2ff1e2f246f14ff0b9f7d1", "baseline_text": "아버지가//칸나를 사랑해//주셨기에…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お父さんが//カンナのことを愛していて//くれたからこそ……", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:2220ffa85a04f173", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1279, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b0f0b1f15781432f2ff288f168f1acf0cff8f4f4a8f0f12f2ff199f984f154f957f9c8f0aff0b8f1488148", "baseline_text": "칸나는，//누구보다도 곧게//살고 있는 거 아니야？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナは、//誰よりもまっすぐに//生きているんじゃないのか。", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:17af38d80e857f66", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1338, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0d8f27ef0a481442f2ff1e1f0af8143f0d8f2f0f1f3f0a4f7d1", "baseline_text": "…그렇지．//맞아，그랬었지…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……そうだな。//そうだったよな……", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:0142b0af84838421", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1373, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0c7f0b8f261f7d12f2ff0b1f957f0a4f17bf0f481432f2ff14af1a7f8c8f27bf15cf0a5f984f154f957f1c8f168f0b18144", "baseline_text": "그러니까…//나는 지금도，//수행을 계속하고 있는 거구나．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だから……//あたいは今でも、//修行を続けているんだな。", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:eb6238f51b3c84ce", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1428, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0b0f0b1f7d12f2ff0ecf8f3f3e5f3ddf8b9f154f0cf81b82f2ff0c1f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "칸나…//적은 눈앞에 있다∈//간다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナ……//敵は目の前だ！//いくぞっ！", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:e81295a67f8b4aab", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1467, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15a81b82f2ff0aff26cf0a4f7d1f167f0aef0bcf0adfd45f144f0a8f2aff7d12f2ff2e4f8f1f94bf26581b8", "baseline_text": "알았어∈//아버지…키리시마류 가라테…//쓰게 해 줘∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解だ！//親父……桐島流空手……//使わせてもらうぜ！", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:08f8eb3f7e921a8b", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1520, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "f0bbf3acf7d1f0b1f8f4f271f272f29ef15a81442f2ff0a5f0a4f1d48143f0d8fa8af0b0f8b1f0faf0dbf0b22f2ff144f8e4fa80f2c9f984f154f957f1c8f276f0af8148", "baseline_text": "글쎄…나도 모르겠어．//하지만，그건 칸나 자신이//가장 잘 알고 있는 거잖아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さあ……俺にもわからないよ。//でも、それはカンナ自身が//一番よくわかってることだろ？", "pointer_offset": 812, "unit": "dialogue:4ef7e5a54577edc7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1605, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f15af3e0f8a4f271f272f29ef15af7d12f2ff0aff26cf0a4f157f7d1f0d8fa62f2632f2ff1a9f0adf2e0f8f4f0a5f8a4f287f0a2f246f0a2f0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "어떨지 모르겠어…//아버지는…그런 말//한마디도 하지 않으셨으니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうなんだろうな……//親父は……そんなこと//一言も言わなかったからな。", "pointer_offset": 816, "unit": "dialogue:755ca52e17e75f42", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1676, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d4f7d1f19cf1442f2ff0aff674f8c8f16ef7d12f2ff27bf95cf49df8c8f2b2f8aff3ebf1f3f0a4f7d1", "baseline_text": "하지만…내가//아팠을 때…//계속 손을 잡아 줬었지…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも……あたいが//病気になったとき……//ずっと手を握っててくれたな……", "pointer_offset": 820, "unit": "dialogue:f7d1785725fec7f6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1747, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f169f184f7d12f2ff28bf2a3f9a9f49df0b2f1f3f15af7d1", "baseline_text": "크고…//따뜻한 손이었어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でっかくて……//あったかい手だったな……", "pointer_offset": 824, "unit": "dialogue:de3ae1021faf407f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1788, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b0f0b1f7d12f2ff0a6f282f0f2f984f154f1f3f276f0af81442f2ff8d8f15ff396f8b2f2d9f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "칸나…//사랑받고 있었잖아．//그 추억이 증거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナ……//愛されていたじゃないか。//その思い出が証拠だよ。", "pointer_offset": 828, "unit": "dialogue:03782b948b7af5f6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1849, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef168f0b1f7d1f0d8f143f947f0b1f15781432f2ff0a4f17bf261f8a4f14af1a7f0c82f2ff27bf15cf94bfabaf94af154f1f3f955f1c8f168f0b18144", "baseline_text": "그렇구나…그래서 나는，//지금까지 수행을//계속해 올 수 있었던 거구나．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうか……だからあたいは、//ずっと修行を//続けてこられたんだな。", "pointer_offset": 832, "unit": "dialogue:ea9755db81ce957c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2507, "capacity": 80, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0aef184f7d1f14af1a7f8c8f27bf15cf0a5f1c7f1472f2ff0aff26cf0a4f8e1f0a6f282f8b9f1acf195fa57f94af154f0cff1842f2ff0c6f0f7f0ccf955f2e1f0a4f8f4f271f272f29ef15a8144", "baseline_text": "그리고…수행을 계속하면서//아버지의 사랑에 보답할 수 있다고//생각했던 걸지도 모르겠어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そして……修行を続けることで//親父の愛に応えられるって//思っていたのかもな。", "pointer_offset": 836, "unit": "dialogue:891043454fff9092", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 1991, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0b0f0b1f7d1", "baseline_text": "칸나…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナ……", "pointer_offset": 840, "unit": "dialogue:23a4dacbfc15afd3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2002, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "fa64f1cef279f14ff0e72f2ff16bf385f8f1f1d4f1daf1f3f0f0f7d12f2ff0b2f8dff273f274f0af8143f0e2f0e48144", "baseline_text": "좀 분위기를//무겁게 만들었네…//이제 괜찮아，대장．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちょっと、しんみり//させちまったな……//もう大丈夫だよ、隊長。", "pointer_offset": 844, "unit": "dialogue:c487d6032691f218", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2065, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f144f0fa8143f0b0f0b181b82f2ff0b2fa6ff16ef1578143f14ef17b2f2ff18bf58ff957f8f1f26ef184f0a8f18481b8", "baseline_text": "좋아，가자，칸나∈//이럴 때는，조금//날뛰는 게 최고라고∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、いこうカンナ！//こんな時には、ちょっと//暴れるのが一番さ！", "pointer_offset": 848, "unit": "dialogue:a72a3e8e617fb287", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2130, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15a81b82f2ff0d8f27ef8f1f263f94bf2e3f18481432f2ff0b1f140f8b9f2cef16af0a5f8a4f0ad81b8", "baseline_text": "알았어∈//그렇게 말해 놓고，//나중에 후회하지 마∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解！//そんなこと言って、//あとで後悔するなよ∈", "pointer_offset": 852, "unit": "dialogue:545c7087a90b3636", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2179, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "81638163816381638163", "baseline_text": "……………", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……………", "pointer_offset": 856, "unit": "dialogue:24d814d999a260ae", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2190, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0abf191f14bf7d12f2ff27df18df1b5f957f0b2f148f14ff39ff0f08144", "baseline_text": "미안해…//쓸데없는 이야기였네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "すまねぇ……//くだらない話だったな。", "pointer_offset": 860, "unit": "dialogue:11be89d3cc26d03c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2227, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b88143f0b1f148f263f0a381432f2ff0aff96bf263f8f4f281f14bf147f7d1f0abf191f14b8144", "baseline_text": "아니，나야말로，//아무 말도 못해서…미안해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや、俺こそ、//なにも言えなくて……ごめん。", "pointer_offset": 864, "unit": "dialogue:d3989d80f4e6ce1b", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2272, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a5f0a58143f0dbf9c2f2e4f8a4f0ad81b82f2ff9aef1f7f9eaf0dbf9c2f991f2e4f0b8fa61f263f0b2f14881b8", "baseline_text": "하하하，신경 쓰지 마∈//난 전혀 신경 안 쓰니까 말이야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ははは、気にすんなって。//あたいは気にしてねぇからさ！", "pointer_offset": 868, "unit": "dialogue:4aff269edb0ac6f8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2327, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f8b9f0aff26cf8a4f5bcf18ff0b9f0a8f0f42f2ff2eef8c8f16ef7d12f2ff374fb75f1b1f15af1acf14ff8a3f257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "다음에 아버지 묘소에라도//갔을 때…//직접 물어보기로 할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度、親父の墓参りにでも//行ったときに……//直接聞いてみることにするよ。", "pointer_offset": 872, "unit": "dialogue:a508b6acd81d8504", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2400, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0a9f7d12f2ff1cff0af8143f14ff9cef1f7f0cbf8c8f279f14bf147f0a8f0f481432f2ff1a9f1abfea7f18bf58ff95af366f26181b8", "baseline_text": "그렇군…//좋아，기분 전환을 위해서라도，//한바탕 날뛰어 볼까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうか……//よし、気分を変えるためにも、//ひと暴れするか！", "pointer_offset": 876, "unit": "dialogue:48d0ce76ae8718ae", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0033", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2459, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15a81b82f2ff167f0aef0bcf0adf545f8e1f0b5f0e1f7d12f2ff1acf9bef1e2f29ef15a81b8", "baseline_text": "알았어∈//키리시마류의 오의…//보여 주겠어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解だ！//桐島流の奥義……//見せてやるぜ∈", "pointer_offset": 880, "unit": "dialogue:18a3361b16c03ef8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN#0034", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03020.SBN", "offset": 2502, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 884, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
